    "created_at": "2026-10-08T16:38:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-08T16:38:04Z",
    "body": "In WHATNOT:\n\n@annevk had a light preference towards \"option 1\", as in you need the `crossorigin` attribute, and therefore a CORS request, for media requests to go through a service worker, even for same origin. He accepted that both options seem ok, but every time we do no-cors stuff it often ends up in a security issues (this whole issue is evidence of that).\n\nNo one else had views either way.\n\n@noamr said he'd raise it with Chrome folks.",
